    "intro_html":  "This is the walking taco in casserole form: seasoned beef and kidney bean chili baked under melted cheese, with salty corn chips for crunch. Each serving packs \u003cstrong\u003e37 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e at about \u003cstrong\u003e$4.25 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). It tastes like the fair, minus the fair prices.",
